    "bbox": [
      93.57,
      258.5,
      531.37,
      273.98
    ],
    "text": "made his order on 26.1.2006 rejecting the objections and holding that the petitioner is a",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.600000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      93.73,
      279.37,
      531.33,
      294.85
    ],
    "text": "lessee and is entitled to notice under section 52 (2) of the Partition Law. The learned",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.600000381469727,
      12.18452262878418
    ]
  },
